      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous SLA tracking
Frequency: Continuous; ~42,900 orders/month
Volume: ~42,900 SLA-tracked orders/month
Owner: Ecommerce Operations Manager
Participants: Ecom Ops Manager, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2292 — Fulfillment Priority &amp; SLA Management</bpmn:documentation>
